WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand in Mountain, feet hip-width. Exhale and hinge into a forward fold.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend the knees as needed and slide the palms under the soles, palms up.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Toes press into the wrists; gently straighten the legs if comfortable.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Let the crown hang heavy and soften the jaw.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Release the hands, bend the knees, and roll up slowly.
